# Лаб. 09 — Payments API (заглушка), усі операції лише для admin (payments:read / process / refund)
@gateway = http://localhost:5000

### Список платежів (payments:read)
GET {{gateway}}/api/payments
Authorization: Bearer <access token alice (admin)>

### Оплата (payments:process)
POST {{gateway}}/api/payments/process
Authorization: Bearer <access token alice (admin)>
Content-Type: application/json

{ "orderId": 1, "amount": 100, "currency": "UAH" }

### Повернення коштів (payments:refund)
POST {{gateway}}/api/payments/refund
Authorization: Bearer <access token alice (admin)>
Content-Type: application/json

{ "paymentId": "<id з відповіді process>", "amount": 10, "reason": "test" }
